      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "• Coonan Property presents this three-bedroom semi-detached holiday home extending to approximately 92 sq.m (990 sq.ft), set within the stunning grounds of Tulfarris Hotel & Golf Resort\n• Accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, living room, kitchen/dining area, sunroom and three generous double bedrooms (ensuite in all bedrooms)\n• Situated within a peaceful cul-de-sac setting, the property is enhanced by beautifully maintained mature trees, shrubs and landscaped flower beds\n• Tulfarris Holiday Village is set within approximately 200 acres of scenic woodland, surrounded by the rolling Wicklow hills and the breathtaking Blessington Lakes\n• Located within the four-star Tulfarris Hotel resort, it offers a range of amenities such as the hotel bar, spa, leisure centre and golf course, all within walking distance \n• Ideally located just 8km from Blessington Village and approximately 33km from Dublin, offering the perfect balance of tranquil countryside living and convenient access to the city\n\nGuide Price\n220,000\n\nType of Transaction\nPrivate Treaty\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Hallway 1.80m x 2.00m\nTiled flooring, chandelier, thermostat and roller blinds. \n\nLiving Room 4.30m x 5.10m\nEngineered oak flooring, recessed lights, feature brick fireplace with wood mantle beam, roller blinds and hot press with shelves. \n \nKitchen/Dining Area 4.30m x 3.00m\nTiled flooring, recessed lights, fully plumbed with floor to wall kitchen cabinets, integrated oven, hob and extractor fan, roller blinds, freestanding undercounter fridge, dishwasher, tiled splashback, stainless steel sink and a glass sliding door that leads into sunroom. \n\nSunroom 3.90m x 2.40m \nTiled flooring, light fitting and glass sliding door leading into rear communal garden. \n\nLanding 3.50m x 1.80m\nCarpet flooring from stairway to landing and a hanging pendant light with shade. \n\nMaster Bedroom (Rear) 4.30m x 2.80m \nCarpet flooring, hanging pendant light with shade, fitted overhead cabinets and wardrobes on both sides. \n\nEnsuite 1.80m x 1.70m\nFully tiled bathroom, light fitting, extractor fan, w.c., w.h.b. with fitted mirror and shaving light, bathtub and shower screen. \n\nBedroom 2 (Front) 3.40m x 2.40m\nCarpet flooring, hanging pendant light with shade, wall lamp, fitted wardrobe, desk and mirror. \n\nEnsuite 1.30m x 1.70m \nFully tiled bathroom, light fitting, extractor fan, w.c., w.h.b. with fitted mirror, shaving light and shower cubicle. \n \nBedroom 3 (2nd Floor) 4.30m x 2.60m\nCarpet flooring, hanging pendant light, wall lamp, fitted overhead cabinets and wardrobes on both sides, eaves storage space, two Velux windows and fitted mirror.\n\nEnsuite 0.80m x 2.90m \nFully tiled bathroom, recessed lights, w.c., w.h.b., Velux window and shower cubicle with Triton system. \n\nManagement Fee\nThe property is subject to an annual management fee. Details to be confirmed.\n\nAdditional Information:\nGross internal floor area approx. 92 sq.m.\nBuilt in 1997\nOutdoor light fitting\nArtificial grass in rear garden \nManagement fees approx. 1,600\n\nItems Included in sale:\nSold as seen \n\nServices:\nMains water \nElectric storage heating\n\nBER\nC \n\nViewing:\nBy appointment only.\n\nEircode\nW91 X5F9\n\nContact Information:\nSales Person \n\nEddie Luca\n&\nJill Wright\nT: 045 832020\nE: naas@coonan.com\n"
      },
